    "detail": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1、公司介绍</span></p>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">公司是一家以现代生物技术为依托，以工业化方式生产食用菌的现代生物农业企业；主营金针菇、真姬菇等鲜品食用菌，是国内金针菇领域龙头企业。</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid0_20221012140854_2236e6608f6e3457.png\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">\n<div data-canvas-width=\"56.32\">公司的收入来源主要分布在东北、华东和华南。</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"56.32\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid15_20221012143112_28ad1a5cbaaadc82.dat\" /></div>\n</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2、行业地位</span></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">截至到2019年6月，公司以1140吨的日产能排名第一；其次是众兴菌业，日产能为775吨；如意情、华绿生物日产能分别为363万吨、327万吨，位列三、四名。</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid3_20221012141313_e6251e8b4e2534e6.dat\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">公司在2016年及以前的净利润规模不及众兴菌业，后不断增长并自2017年开始实现反超，到2019年实现归母净利润2.2亿，同比增长45.47%，同业望尘莫及。</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid4_20221012142142_59729e57185cb4b7.png\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid7_20221012142153_c70ce054b4ffc27c.dat\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">食用菌行业中，华绿生物的净资产收益率水平较高，公司次之，众兴菌业的ROE较低。在盈利能力方面，众兴菌业与华绿生物的净利润率和毛利率均较高，公司的盈利水平与之相差不大</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid9_20221012142334_9defb0f27ea6214f.dat\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid11_20221012142544_7ae32fd85c80cf80.dat\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">从售价来看，公司的产品平均价格明显高于其他企业。</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid13_20221012142744_b55fa89e6e72d58f.dat\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">3、行业近年来增长稳定未来仍有足够空间挖掘</span></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">近年来中国食用菌总产量平稳增长，香菇是第一大食用菌品种。2018年全国食用菌总产量3842.04万吨，2019年增至3961.91万吨，增长率维持在3%左右。按食用菌品种来看，香菇是我国第一大食用菌品种，2018年产量达1043.12万吨，结构占比27.15%，其次是黑木耳产量674.03万吨，平菇、双孢蘑菇、金针菇、杏鲍菇和毛木耳分别位居3-7位，是我国食用菌生产的常规主品种，总占比达食用菌总产量的85%以上。</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid19_20221012144442_bdc38f6698cfc06e.dat\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid17_20221012144408_b26cbaa91125ffd1.dat\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">根据中国食用菌协会数据，2014年，中国的食用菌产量全球占比超70%；根据FAO统计，2014年全球食用菌贸易额为53亿美元，其中中国占比达到50%多。</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid21_20221012144505_ae6335a02a1314ac.dat\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid23_20221012144514_4c27d173f10003ec.dat\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">与发达国家及地区相比，我国工厂化尚有很大的发展空间，未来几年仍将是发展的黄金时期。据华经情报网预计，未来10年内工厂化种植产量将达到食用菌总产量的20%～30%。</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid25_20221012144617_ac16d084dfa0242c.dat\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">工厂化金针菇市场已经步入加速淘汰落后产能阶段，行业进入门槛提升。公司是国内金针菇龙头，成本与生产效率稳定优势行业领先</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid26_20221012144656_d879a4161aa2dee4.png\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">4、公司治理：激励&amp;合伙人制度促进公司散发新活力</span></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">公司2020年5月15日通过《关于向激励对象首次授予限制性股票的议案》，公司向公司170余位核心员工授予1280万股公司限制性股票，授予价格4.22元/股。限制性股票解除限售条件分别为：以2017-2019年公司净利润均值为基数，2020-2022年净利润增长分别不低于30%、45%和60%。本次授予计划的完成有效绑定管理人员与技术人员利益，为公司后期产能扩张做好人才储备。</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/blobid28_20221012144757_cec8faf953315547.png\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">5、风险提示</span></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">\n<div data-canvas-width=\"44.8\">电价阶段性上涨，蔬菜价格表现低于预期。</div>\n</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"314.4592\">&nbsp;</div>",
